(text
"One 2.54mm-pitch connector replaces nine separate header bodies.\nPin 1 REF; pin 2 BIAS; pins 3..10 CH8..CH1. Labels follow the physical order.\nNo scalp electrode connects directly to system GND.\nShort raw-electrode stubs enter the matched protection/filter bank, then ADS1299 inputs.\nAMOLED stacks ABOVE the mainboard on 8mm insulated standoffs, to the right of this connector.\nKeep the left plug-in zone and the ESP antenna clear. All mainboard SMD parts are on TOP.\nBefore charging, physically unplug the complete electrode harness, including REF and BIAS.\nMatched isolated power daughterboard is detachable; no USB SYS path powers acquisition."
(at
20.32
177.8
0)
